  "contract": [
    "Replace variable clear-byte remainder with a balanced base-four digit sum modulo three and low-bit residues for all supported 1/2/3/4/6/8/12/16-byte pixels",
    "Preserve three/six/twelve-byte repetition across 64-bit boundaries, masked neighbor bits, clear/discard/load behavior and highest slot addresses",
    "Capture merged maintenance write data before the SRAM edge; update validity/dirty state only on the committed write",
    "Cancellation before the new write edge suppresses it and retains an immutable fault reply until consumed; maintenance writes add one cycle"
  ],
